    "title": "Jennifer Lopez recalls losing eyesight after 98 straight workdays early in career - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexis Garcia ,\n6 hours ago Jennifer Lopez is opening up about a grueling stretch early in her career that left her physically depleted after working nonstop for more than three months. During the June 15 episode of the \"SmartLess\" podcast with Jason Bateman, Sean Hayes and Will Arnett, the 56-year-old actress and singer recalled a period when she worked 98 consecutive days without a break. Read full article",
